The device configuration row (cpu_cfg, cpu_add_row, cpu_lab, cpu_nop in
entries.S) and the page's mechanics (cpu_open, cpu_key and the page's
destructors and encoder handler: the stock machine-select page with a private
copy of its vtables, presented as the stock opener presents a page) follow
Model-TG's System page (https://github.com/TinyGregAudio/Model-TG,
src/model_tg.s: cfg_hook, lm_add_row, gm_lab, sys_nop, mm_open, mm_key,
mm_enc): Copyright (c) 2026 TinyGregAudio, MIT License, its text in
tweaks/model-cycles_OS1.13/LICENSE-Model-TG.
